</span><span class="l">Board and affiliation</span></li><li><span class="v">36</span><span class="l">Years since founding</span></li></ul><p class="asof">Figures as of 15 October 2026.</p></div></section><section id="news" aria-labelledby="h-news"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-news">News</h2><ul class="news"><li><article class="pic"><img src="/api/files/f-news?w=640" alt="Children racing" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Sports day</h3><time datetime="2026-10-01">1 October 2026</time><p>Races and a &lt;script&gt;alert(1)&lt;/script&gt; tug of war.</p></div></article></li></ul></div></section><section id="gallery" aria-labelledby="h-gallery"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-gallery">Gallery</h2><ul class="gallery"><li><img src="/api/files/f-gallery?w=640" alt="The prize table" loading="lazy"></li></ul></div></section><section id="admissions" aria-labelledby="h-admissions"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-admissions">Admissions</h2><p>Forms open in January.</p><form class="enquiry" method="post" action="/enquiry"><h3>Ask about admission</h3><input type="hidden" name="lang" value="en"><label>Your name<input name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Your phone or email<input name="contact" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="tel"></label><label>Class you are asking about (optional)<input name="grade" maxlength="60"></label><label>Your question<textarea name="message" required maxlength="2000" rows="4"></textarea></label><div class="hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><p class="note">We use these details only to answer you.</p><button type="submit">Send</button></form></div></section><section id="contact" aria-labelledby="h-contact"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="h-contact">Contact</h2><dl class="contact"><dt>Address</dt><dd>1 River Road, Pune, Maharashtra, 411001</dd><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+912012345678">+91 20 1234 5678</a></dd><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:office@zz-river.test">office@zz-river.test</a></dd><dt>Office hours</dt><dd>Monday to Saturday, 9 to 4</dd></dl><p><a href="https://maps.example.test/river" rel="noopener">Open the map</a></p></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><p>ZZ River School · 1 River Road, Pune, Maharashtra, 411001</p><p><a href="https://app.example.test">Built with Shalaghar</a></p></div></footer></body></html>"`;

